# Spirit Box source of truth

Before planning or implementing any substantive work, read `docs/00_SPIRIT_BOX_PRODUCT_SOURCE_OF_TRUTH.md`. Treat it as authoritative.

`docs/research/` is supporting evidence only. If research conflicts with the canonical document, the canonical document wins.

Do not expand V1 scope without explicit instruction. Do not silently change audio architecture, pricing, trust language, core workflow, or product positioning.

Keep work scoped to the current branch and assigned task.

The central product loop is **START → LISTEN → MARK → REPLAY**.
